CLASS:: MP3Unpack
SUMMARY:: Read a compressed file directly into band signals
CATEGORIES:: UGens>MPEG Audio
RELATED:: Guides/MPEGAudio, Classes/MP3Pack, Classes/MPEGFrame

DESCRIPTION::
Read indexed MPEG audio frames at the file’s clock. The transport exposes words and coding fields without a PCM round trip.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: ar
Set run to 0 and then 1 to replay from the beginning.

ARGUMENT:: path
Full path on the server, supplied as a String when building the SynthDef.

ARGUMENT:: channels
One or two output channels. Supply an integer when compiling the SynthDef.

ARGUMENT:: run
A rising edge starts a take or starts reading at the beginning. A falling edge finishes the take or stops reading.

ARGUMENT:: downsample
Native clock divisor from 1 to 6. A reader samples this at start. Connected field streams preserve the original codec clock.

RETURNS:: An MPEGFrame with fields, marker, format, bytes and status. Read running to gate a writer through EOF.
